WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Responsive web design provides an optimum

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
viewing experience for desktop, tablet

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.000
and mobile devices.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
begin by creating a wireframe for each viewport.

5
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Larger viewports allow for multiple columns of content.

6
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Use a single column layout for mobile viewports.

7
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
when the wireframe is complete, you can begin the web page development.

